<title>USA: Jason unit gets award in China patent case.</title>
<headline>Jason unit gets award in China patent case.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jason Inc said Wednesday its Koller Group subsidiary won patent infringement litigation in China and was awarded $120,000 in damages.</p>
<p>Jason said a decision in Koller's favor was made by the Patent Administration Office in Shenzhen, China, in a case brought against  Tin Cheung, a Hong Kong metal stamping company with a factory in Shenzhen.</p>
